Zstandard 1.5.6 reference decoder (BSD-3-Clause, see LICENSE), unmodified files from facebook/zstd lib/common and
lib/decompress (release tarball sha256 8c29e06cf42aacc1eafc4077ae2ec6c6fcb96a626157e0593d5e82a34fd403c1), without the
assembly Huffman path (build with -DZSTD_DISABLE_ASM). Used only by nm_unzstd.c to unpack NVIDIA's driver package on a Mac.
